{"availability":"available","full":"Gmpho/strike-tips-autonomous-","name":"strike-tips-autonomous-","description":"🏇Strike Tips Racing Bot AI-powered South African horse racing intelligence system. Scrapes live odds from Betway, analyzes form/ratings via local LLMs (Ollama) with Gemini/Groq fallback identifies value bets using Kelly criterion, auto-settles results, and pushes alerts via Telegram. Backend on Modal, HUD on Vercel, state in Redis Cloud + ChromaDB","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-03-25T08:06:01Z","updated":"2026-10-09T10:07:31Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://strike-tips-hud.pages.dev/dashboard  ","topics":[],"demo":"https://strike-tips-hud.pages.dev/dashboard","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:37:10.537Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:37:10.537Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:37:10.537Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:48:13.751Z","stars":4,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:37:10.537Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["South African Horse Racing Intelligence System","A modular, AI-powered betting assistant that identifies value bets in South African horse racing using probability edge analysis and disciplined bankroll management.","3-Layer Architecture: Cloudflare edge (always-free) → Modal serverless backend → Cloudflare Pages frontend, with an OKF (On-Device Knowledge) bundle of 15 curated SA racing docs."],"features":["🏇 Race Analysis - Identifies value bets using probability edge (not tips, mathematical advantage)","💰 Smart Bankroll Manager - Enforces disciplined staking (max 5% per bet, daily loss limits)","🤖 AI Agents - Model Pipeline with specialist models for fast responses","📱 Telegram Notifications - Sends tips and updates directly to your phone","🔧 Self-Healing Parsers - Adapts when racing websites change structure"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Gmpho/s